Subject: [PATCH] gate: add the Assurance Gate project page and card

Adds an eighth AI builder project: a release assurance dashboard with
pre registered gates, confidence bounds, coverage and a paired regression.

- portfolio: the card first in the grid, counts moved to eight
- gate/index.html: problem, solution, result, success criteria, metrics
- the live dashboard loads from its Space only after a click on the poster
- README: the gate page names its own outside request
